   "title": "CHINA DIARIES: The Future of farming",
   "url": "https://dailytrust.com/china-diaries-the-future-of-farming/",
   "domain": "dailytrust.com",
   "source": "Daily Trust（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Sun, 15 Nov 2026 06:53:08 +0000",
   "_dt": 1794725588.0,
   "ageDays": 0.71,
   "summary": "When we talk about China’s development, the images that often come to mind are high-speed trains, towering skyscrapers, electric vehicles and impressive infrastructure. But there is another quiet revolution taking place, one that is just as important to China’s future: agriculture.",
   "summary_zh": "谈到中国的发展，人们脑海中常常浮现高速列车、高耸的摩天大楼、电动汽车和令人瞩目的基础设施。但另一场安静的变革也在发生，而且它对中国的未来同样重要：农业。",
   "summarySource": "index",
   "body": "When we talk about China’s development, the images that often come to mind are high-speed trains, towering skyscrapers, electric vehicles and impressive infrastructure. But there is another quiet revolution taking place, one that is just as important to China’s future: agriculture. I had an opportunity to explore this during a visit to Yangling, in Shaanxi […]",
