   "title": "Beijing details N. Korean leader's China visit in FM talks with Seoul: official",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/20261114/beijing-details-n-korean-leaders-china-visit-in-fm-talks-with-seoul-official",
