   "summary": "The Governor gave the assurance on Friday during a visit to the headquarters of the 24 Task Force Brigade in Dikwa Local Government Area where he met with the Brigade Commander, Brigadier General Aminu Gumel.",
   "summary_zh": "州长周五在迪克瓦地方政府辖区第24特遣旅部总部视察期间作出上述保证，并会见了旅长 Aminu Gumel 准将。",
